ng and depending on  which version of the game you get the  story events and the unit classes you'll  have access to will be drastically  different play all of them hyper light  drifter hyper light drifter might be one  of the best games of the year the  vibrant colors make hyper light drifter  stand out while its controls in its  combat system are fantastic  exploring never gets boring or  repetitive and as you play you learn  more about the world of its dangers  soon you'll be completely sucked in and  never want to leave uncharted for a  thief's end the fourth game in the  Uncharted series is already a modern  classic after enjoying monumental  success with the first three  installments developer Naughty Dog rose  to the challenge and topped themselves  uncharted 4 exceeded expectations and in  the series in a high note thanks with  great storytelling and amazingly  gorgeous visuals in gameplay  uncharted 4 is a must buy for all ps4  owners overwatch what can we say about  blizzards team-based shooter overwatch  that hasn't been said a thousand times  already that it managed to breathe new  life into a tire John rrah that has got  something to offer for every type of  player that it's cast of colorful  characters tight controls and fantastic  visuals all contribute to being simply  one of the most fun games to come out  this year yeah that about covers all of  it go get overwatch we'll be waiting for  you and thanks for watching subscribe to  our YouTube channel to watch more videos  at the one you just saw and leave a  comment to let us know which games you  think should have made the list
 

